        "original_id": "8167a805-e7be-5736-8b40-db438634a5c4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Leo, Ravi\n- Bands and Units: Stiltskin, Genesis, VIXX, VIXX LR\n- Companies: Jellyfish Entertainment\n- Products: She\n- Roles: vocalist, singer, songwriter, musical theatre actor, rapper\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968 and is a Scottish musician.\n- Leo, born Jung Taek-woon on 10 November 1990, is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and musical theatre actor.\n- Leo is signed under Jellyfish Entertainment.\n- Ray Wilson was a vocalist in Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- Ray Wilson is best known as a vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin.\n- In August 2015, VIXX LR was established as a unit consisting of VIXX's main vocalist Leo and main rapper Ravi.\n- She is the second album by Stiltskin.\n- Stiltskin was led by Ray Wilson at the time of the album She.",
